  "body": "Resource-audit step based on stable 0d17c53.\n\n- install a headless-only BrowserContext route guard\n- abort only image/media subresources while the top-level page is the real Vinted catalog\n- never block document/script/style/XHR/fetch traffic\n- keep Cloudflare/hCaptcha/reCAPTCHA challenge assets available\n- fail open when request classification is uncertain\n- cover catalog scope, functional traffic, lookalike hosts and challenge exceptions with unit tests\n\nNo login, inbox, item-detail, session persistence, scheduler cadence, negotiation logic, frontend or backend behavior is changed.",
